OL,3,ADame Esther Rantzen, broadcaster,
OL,4,Acampaigner and charity founder, dies
OL,5,Aaged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FBroadcaster and campaigner Dame Esther
OL,8,FRantzen has died aged 86
OL,10,FRantzen was known for presenting the
OL,11,FBBC TV programme, That's Life, and
OL,12,Flater went on to set up Childline, the
OL,13,Fhelpline for children suffering abuse
OL,14,For neglect
OL,16,FRantzen also campaigned for the
OL,17,Flegalisation of assisted dying, and
OL,18,Furged MPs to back legislation - our
OL,19,Fmedical editor writes that when the
OL,20,Fbill failed, Rantzen called it "a
OL,21,Ftragic day"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
