OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AResidents near RAF Fairford left 'like
OL,4,Asitting ducks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs 85 homes were evacuated in the
OL,7,Fmiddle of the night, one couple said
OL,8,Ftheir child had been left traumatised
OL,9,Fafter witnessing armed police point a
OL,10,Fgun at their father. The BBC has
OL,11,Fapproached Counter Terrorism Policing
OL,12,Ffor comment.
OL,14,FHowever, an anonymous resident from
OL,15,FWhelford said she "could not fault" the
OL,16,Fquick response of UK authorities,
OL,17,Fdescribing officers as "calm, thorough
OL,18,Fand precise".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
